            "_id": "23d8f958-ad19-c49b-6c23-7b1c777443c2",
            "text": true,
            "v": " You can combine any number of connectors to create completely automated, multi and advanced steps workflows including conditional, parallel and loop steps. This means that when a first operation finishes, a second operation automatically executes. There is no limit to the number of steps that can be connected in this way."
